log "opticslab: shot 2 captured (TIR)"

# ── SHOT 3: afocal pair ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Diverging Lens 1 (R1 -100, R2 +40) then converging Lens 2 (R1 +78, R2 -71),
# front surfaces 21 mm apart -> composite C = 0 exactly (afocal), rays leave
# parallel, readout shows EFL:N/A. Selection ends on Lens 2 so the label prints
# 'Sel:Lens 2 ... | EFL:N/A'.
